  "description": "The 8bar GRUNEWALD STEEL is made for gravel rides and long days in the saddle. Perfect for asphalt, forest paths and gravel.\n\nThe sporty yet balanced riding position provides a direct ride feel while staying comfortable enough for long tours and bikepacking adventures.\n\nThe steel frame combines classic character with modern technology. Slim tubes, a timeless look and the pleasantly comfortable ride feel of steel meet fully internal cable routing, a SRAM UDH derailleur hanger, a T47 bottom bracket and clearance for tires up to 50 mm. The result is a clean look, modern performance, high stiffness and maximum versatility.\n\nDesigned in Berlin and inspired by the gravel tracks of the Grunewald forest, the GRUNEWALD STEEL is ready for fast after-work rides, long adventures and everything in between.\n\nBALANCED GEOMETRY\n\nFeels lively on fast rides and stable when loaded for adventure. Built for long days, quick detours and everything in between.\n\nCLEAN DESIGN & AERODYNAMICS\n\nOne of the first production steel frames designed for fully internal drivetrain cable routing, giving it a clean look and improved aerodynamics.\n\nBIG TIRES. BIG PLANS.\n\nUp to 50 mm tire clearance for more grip, more comfort and more freedom to leave smooth pavement behind.\n\nSTEEL IS REAL.\n\nA timeless material with a clean look. Strong yet comfortable and made to last.\n\nREADY TO BIKEPACKING\n\nWith rack and mudguard mounts, plus an additional bottle cage mount on the downtube, it’s ready to be packed up, built for touring and taken wherever the road leads.\n\nSRAM UDH READY\n\nMaking it fully prepared for modern drivetrain systems. This ensures better compatibility, easier service, and long-term future-proofing.\n\nT47 BOTTOM BRACKET\n\nThe T47 bottom bracket allows for fully internal cable routing and increased stiffness.",
